      "source": "Teaching model of pneumonia progressing to septic shock (Surviving Sepsis Campaign 2021 definitions: vasopressors needed for MAP ≥ 65 and lactate > 2 mmol/L despite fluids). Effect sizes and time course are teaching parameters.",
